e">28</strong><h1>Digital Wallet</h1></header><p>Payment platforms usually =
provide a digital wallet service to clients, so they can store money in the=
 wallet and spend it later. For example, you can add money to your digital =
wallet from your bank card and when you buy products online, you are given =
the option to pay using the money in your wallet. Figure 1 shows this proce=
ss.</p>
