<p><strong>Second phase: Confirm</strong></p>
<p>If both databases reply =E2=80=9Cyes=E2=80=9D, the wallet service starts=
 the next Confirm phase.</p>
<p>Account A=E2=80=99s balance has already been updated in the first phase.=
 The wallet service does not need to change its balance. However, account C=
 has not yet received its $1 from account A in the first phase. In the Conf=
irm phase, the wallet service has to add $1 to account C=E2=80=99s balance.=
</p>
<p>The Confirm process is shown in Figure 8.</p>
